{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":74,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I've written both rule files, the explanation, the notes and the predictions in `work/`. No simulator was run, so the TTS figures below are predictions only.\n\n**The policy.** The network never really extends a green. At the first honoured decision (12 s of green) it switches about 97% of the time.\n- **Choosing the next phase:** it picks whichever other phase has the highest weighted stop-line demand. A stopped car counts double, and left-pocket cars count about 1.3× a typical through-lane car.\n- **Transition bonuses:** a fixed bonus depends on which phase just ended. NS-left strongly follows NS-through, and NS-through is favoured after EW-left.\n- **Main-road priority:** EW-through demand counts about 2.5× NS-through demand.\n- **One exception:** it holds EW-left for another 5 s when a left pocket is still occupied and other demand is light.\n- **What it ignores:** elapsed green time, upstream queues (it effectively sees about 3 cars per lane), and mostly lane N0.\n- **Where it may do badly:** the 3 s yellow after every 12 s green eats capacity at high demand. It also behaves erratically when everything is congested.\n\n**Fidelity on the recorded states (honoured decisions):**\n\n| file | comparisons | all recorded states | network's own runs |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `rules_small.py` | 6 | 0.902 | 0.904 |\n| `rules_full.py` | 6 | 0.912 | 0.915 |\n\n**Predictions** (`predictions.json`):\n- fidelity_small 0.89, fidelity_full 0.90\n- tts_small 45.1 veh-h, tts_full 45.0 veh-h (the network scored 44.8 on the dev episodes)","ttft_ms":1097,"type":"result","duration_ms":1486022,"uuid":"55b48aa7-aa59-4367-adf7-4a17ed9c5e31","ttft_stream_ms":911,"time_to_request_ms":50,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":2,"system_prompt":7,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":1,"input_attachments":9,"input_hooks":1,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":3,"tool_pool_refresh":